        rdfs:comment            "Purse made by ballerina Marie Taglioni (1804-1884).   Croched in silk with metal clasp."@en , "Fine blue silk crochet purse (unfinished) with band of steel beads in serrated pattern to upper edge, the edge being alternating blue and black blocks.  The loose stitch held by a gold safety pin."@en ;
